182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (With the increasing use of digital documents across government, education, healthcare, and enterprises, multilingual document translation has become essential. However, most existing machine translation systems translate only plain text and fail to preserve the original document structure, resulting in the loss of headings, tables, images, text boxes, formatting, and reading order. This often requires extensive manual editing after translation. Therefore, there is a need for an intelligent, layout-aware document translation system that can accurately extract, translate, and reconstruct documents while preserving their original structure and formatting across multiple languages. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
